OL,3,GNEWSAFood bank launches appeal as costs
OL,4,Aclimb and donations fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe people who walk through the doors
OL,7,Fof St Paul's Charity are often carrying
OL,8,Fmore than the burden of empty
OL,9,Fcupboards, says chief executive Jez
OL,10,FChalmers.
OL,12,FMany arrive feeling embarrassed and
OL,13,Fashamed that they are struggling to
OL,14,Fcope.
OL,16,F"The truth is, any one of us could find
OL,17,Fourselves facing a moment of hardship,
OL,18,Fso we do what we can," he said.
